          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links 1: Topik Populer -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-brand-charcoal dark:text-gray-100 mb-4">
          Topik Populer
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-brand-charcoal/80 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>
            <a href="/blog/resep-puree-pertama-bayi-6-bulan" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Resep Puree 6 Bulan</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog/trik-mengatasi-anak-gtm-feeding-rules" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Trik Atasi Anak GTM</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog/perbandingan-blw-vs-spoon-feeding" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">BLW vs Spoon-Feeding</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog/mencegah-anemia-zat-besi-tanda-alergi-mpasi" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Cegah Anemia & Alergi</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links 2: Panduan & Alat -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-brand-charcoal dark:text-gray-100 mb-4">
          Panduan & Alat
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-brand-charcoal/80 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>
            <a href="/panduan" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Tahapan Tekstur Usia</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog/review-perlengkapan-mpasi-slow-cooker-vs-food-processor" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Review Slow Cooker</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/panduan#meal-prep" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Meal Prep Ibu Bekerja</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/panduan#feeding-rules" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Standar IDAI Feeding Rules</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links 3: Info & Komunitas -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-brand-charcoal dark:text-gray-100 mb-4">
          Tentang & Bantuan
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-brand-charcoal/80 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>
            <a href="/about" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Tentang MangkokKecil</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/about#visi-misi" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Visi & Misi Nutrisi</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Semua Artikel Blog</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/sitemap-index.xml" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Sitemap XML</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Disclaimer & Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-brand-charcoal-muted dark:text-gray-400">
      <p class="text-center md:text-left max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Pemberitahuan Medis:</strong> Seluruh artikel di MangkokKecil disusun untuk tujuan edukasi berdasarkan rekomendasi IDAI dan WHO. Selalu konsultasikan kebutuhan gizi dan riwayat alergi khusus si Kecil dengan dokter spesialis anak.
      </p>

      <p class="whitespace-nowrap">
        &copy; {currentYear} <strong>MangkokKecil</strong>. Dibuat dengan cinta untuk Ibu Indonesia.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
